---
title: Arugula Salad with Feta
description: A fresh and peppery arugula salad with juicy cherry tomatoes, salty feta, and a sweet-tangy honey mustard dressing.
servings: 2
prep time: 15 minutes
tags:
  - salads
  - vegetarian
  - quick
source: https://www.gaumenfreundin.de/rucola-salat/#rezept
---

Wash and dry @arugula{125%g}. Halve @cherry tomatoes{250%g}.

In a #small bowl{}, whisk together @extra virgin olive oil{4%tbsp}, @white balsamic vinegar{2%tbsp}, @Dijon mustard{1%tsp}, @honey{1%tsp}, @fine sea salt{1/2%tsp}, and @black pepper{1/4%tsp} until the dressing is well emulsified.

In a #large salad bowl{}, combine the @arugula{}, @cherry tomatoes{}, and crumbled @feta{150%g}. Pour the dressing over the salad and toss gently to coat everything evenly.
